WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.300
Safex

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:17.908
They were attacked by a winter storm.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:21.449
They worked together
to overcome the storm.

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.922
Cookie was injured unexpectedly.

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:29.358
After the storm,
there's something in front of them...

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:31.821
A land over the horizon.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.963
It's America.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:38.834
America is now right in front of her.

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:45.839
The port through the window.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.117
It's America.

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:03.386
I'm home,
sister Pony, sister Lane!

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.564
And Terry,
you are now in America too.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:10.031
America, I'm coming!

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:12.897
America!

00:01:13.047 --> 00:01:15.702
How do you feel?
You are for the first time in America.

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:18.777
It feels so real.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:32.150
The ship can stop at the port directly.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.090
You know that too, Cookie!

00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:38.355
I have learnt the details already.

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:04.252
Arrived safely at last.

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:08.031
Thank you, captain Nieven.

00:02:08.181 --> 00:02:11.892
I hope that this is the last time
I will be shipping people as cargo.

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:14.966
Yes, I won't run a blockade again.

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:19.531
I'll send you to the hospital, Cookie.

00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:22.600
What would happen if my foot...

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:25.269
Don't worry, I'll go with you.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:28.840
Captain!

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:31.281
Is that your lovely daughter?

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:36.512
Papa!

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.416
Sandra!

00:02:38.566 --> 00:02:40.789
Welcome back, papa!

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:43.121
Is she your daughter?

00:02:43.271 --> 00:02:45.027
She's too lively.

00:02:55.808 --> 00:02:57.366
Welcome back, papa!

00:02:58.411 --> 00:02:59.637
Who are they?

00:02:59.787 --> 00:03:01.873
Glad to meet you, I am Candy.

00:03:02.023 --> 00:03:03.575
I'm Cookie.

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:06.044
They are stowaways on Sea-Gull?

00:03:06.194 --> 00:03:07.378
No, I am...

00:03:07.528 --> 00:03:09.796
Sandra, go back home and wait for me.

00:03:09.946 --> 00:03:12.448
Cookie needs to see the doctor.

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:15.053
Papa!

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:31.571
Ow!

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:36.310
How is the situation, Doctor?

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:38.877
It is not a simple fracture.

00:03:39.027 --> 00:03:41.420
Is the nerve ok?

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:44.249
Who wrapped him up?

00:03:44.399 --> 00:03:46.224
I did.

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:49.326
Is there any problem?

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:51.756
No, you did very well.

00:03:51.906 --> 00:03:54.623
He will recover soon.

00:03:54.773 --> 00:03:57.964
Cookie will be able to walk then?

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:00.195
No need to worry!

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:04.809
Can I be a sailor?

00:04:05.345 --> 00:04:07.539
The doctor can't decide that.

00:04:07.689 --> 00:04:12.110
I can only guarantee that
you will walk again in a month.

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:15.380
Wonderful! I can be a sailor!

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:16.881
Cookie!

00:04:17.031 --> 00:04:19.789
Thanks for your help, Candy.

00:04:21.561 --> 00:04:24.223
Let's do the treatment now.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.493
Sandra!

00:04:28.643 --> 00:04:30.229
I want to talk to you, papa.

00:04:33.373 --> 00:04:36.604
Papa cares for the stowaways
more than of its own daughter.

00:04:36.809 --> 00:04:38.504
What are you talking about, Sandra?

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:40.305
I hate you, papa!

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:44.609
I was right,
you do have other women.

00:04:44.759 --> 00:04:46.174
Sandra!

00:04:46.919 --> 00:04:50.348
Wait! Captain Nieven
worries about Cookie's injury.

00:04:50.498 --> 00:04:52.980
So he brought him to the doctor.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:57.789
He got hurt because
he sneaked onto papa's ship.

00:04:57.939 --> 00:04:59.290
Sandra!

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.026
Papa never cares about me.

00:05:02.535 --> 00:05:04.059
Where are you going, Sandra?

00:05:04.937 --> 00:05:06.598
To the police, of course.

00:05:06.748 --> 00:05:10.235
Papa came home with two stowaways.

00:05:10.385 --> 00:05:11.603
- What?
- Just a moment.

00:05:11.753 --> 00:05:13.238
Don't act foolishly, Sandra.

00:05:13.388 --> 00:05:15.076
Let me talk to her.

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:19.781
Sandra, let me explain!

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:26.951
You're Candy, aren't you?

00:05:27.101 --> 00:05:28.486
It's over six months...

00:05:28.636 --> 00:05:31.758
Papa stays with me only two days.

00:05:31.964 --> 00:05:33.091
Two days?

00:05:33.241 --> 00:05:37.603
From England to America,
you were together all the time.

00:05:38.504 --> 00:05:42.700
He is wit others' daughter
more than with his own daughter.

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:44.602
Is that right?

00:05:44.752 --> 00:05:48.522
A captain's job is like that.

00:05:48.672 --> 00:05:51.042
The job... Nonsense!

00:05:51.192 --> 00:05:52.345
Wait! Sandra!

00:06:04.997 --> 00:06:08.593
Sandra,
is she the stowaway from England?

00:06:08.743 --> 00:06:09.794
Yes!

00:06:10.436 --> 00:06:13.098
Are you Sandra's friends?

00:06:13.406 --> 00:06:15.067
That's right, we are friends.

00:06:18.745 --> 00:06:22.203
Such a lovely girl,
how could she be a stowaway?

00:06:23.116 --> 00:06:24.743
What do you want? Stop!

00:06:25.651 --> 00:06:27.482
You're very brave.

00:06:35.862 --> 00:06:37.989
Isn't that a raccoon?

00:06:39.098 --> 00:06:41.430
Catch him!
It may sell for a good price.

00:06:42.702 --> 00:06:45.227
Stop it! Don't hurt Kurin!

00:06:45.938 --> 00:06:48.733
How about joining us?

00:06:48.883 --> 00:06:52.938
I have not come back to America
to join a street gang!

00:06:53.579 --> 00:06:54.807
You bitch!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.842
You are nothing but a stowaway.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:07.518
Sandra, I'll make it a present for you.

00:07:07.668 --> 00:07:09.322
Thanks!

00:07:09.996 --> 00:07:11.463
Kurin!

00:07:15.001 --> 00:07:16.798
Kurin, hurry up!

00:07:17.136 --> 00:07:18.364
Stop!

00:07:19.839 --> 00:07:21.966
Over there! Get her!

00:07:30.483 --> 00:07:32.314
Look out, Kurin!

00:07:48.668 --> 00:07:49.727
Thank Goodness!

00:07:49.877 --> 00:07:51.463
For what?

00:07:57.043 --> 00:07:58.704
You looked down on us!

00:07:59.045 --> 00:08:01.272
Give me the money,
if you don't want to join us.

00:08:01.422 --> 00:08:03.008
I have no money.

00:08:03.583 --> 00:08:05.610
Then, I'll take the raccoon.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:06.911
Someone's coming!

00:08:07.061 --> 00:08:08.146
What?

00:08:08.588 --> 00:08:10.177
It's the crew of the Sea-Gull.

00:08:10.327 --> 00:08:11.449
Let's go!

00:08:12.959 --> 00:08:14.519
- Don't leave, Sandra!
- Let go of me!

00:08:14.669 --> 00:08:16.755
- Hurry up!
- Let go of me!

00:08:18.097 --> 00:08:19.758
- Candy!
- Go!

00:08:21.567 --> 00:08:24.058
- Are you hurt?
- I'm fine.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:25.769
What is the matter?

00:08:26.038 --> 00:08:29.734
I was taking a walk with Sandra,
ran into them...

00:08:29.884 --> 00:08:32.703
It might be a ploy, be careful.

00:08:32.853 --> 00:08:35.076
Are you OK, Miss?

00:08:54.367 --> 00:08:56.360
The stair is dark, be careful.

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.361
Yes!

00:08:57.511 --> 00:09:00.166
Papa cares about Candy very much.

00:09:11.684 --> 00:09:14.244
I need a bath.

00:09:17.790 --> 00:09:19.587
The port!

00:09:19.926 --> 00:09:22.292
Why did you cover me?

00:09:22.862 --> 00:09:24.188
I didn't.

00:09:24.338 --> 00:09:29.030
You can tell the truth to my father
that Sandra is a bad girl.

00:09:29.969 --> 00:09:31.664
Where is your mother?

00:09:31.971 --> 00:09:33.729
She passed away when I was six.

00:09:33.879 --> 00:09:38.736
I live with my grandmother.
She is home only in the evening.

00:09:38.886 --> 00:09:41.177
Any more questions?

00:09:41.747 --> 00:09:44.841
Waiting for your father by yourself...

00:09:45.318 --> 00:09:48.116
Your father was busy on the ship.

00:09:49.488 --> 00:09:53.117
Can you understand how I feel?

00:09:53.793 --> 00:09:55.192
So comfortable!

00:09:57.863 --> 00:10:00.258
You seem to have reconciled.

00:10:00.408 --> 00:10:03.063
I should leave now.

00:10:03.436 --> 00:10:06.030
Why don't you stay with us for dinner?

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:10.439
You've not seen Sandra for over six months.

00:10:11.711 --> 00:10:13.638
Don't worry about that.

00:10:13.788 --> 00:10:17.124
The doctors will look after Cookie.

00:10:17.274 --> 00:10:19.477
I'd like to have dinner on the ship.

00:10:19.627 --> 00:10:22.612
- There's no need.
- It's because...

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.214
Candy, look!

00:10:28.794 --> 00:10:30.762
Don't be anxious to leave.

00:10:51.317 --> 00:10:55.117
Why did Sandra took Candy home?

00:10:55.588 --> 00:10:57.078
It's getting cold here.

00:10:58.190 --> 00:10:59.248
Quick!

00:11:06.966 --> 00:11:08.957
Back to the company at once?

00:11:09.335 --> 00:11:12.600
They want to see you immediately...

00:11:13.406 --> 00:11:15.533
OK, let me put on the uniform.

00:11:23.349 --> 00:11:25.783
You're going at sea again?

00:11:26.185 --> 00:11:29.279
I don't know. Candy, help yourself.

00:11:32.158 --> 00:11:33.853
It's always like that!

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:36.220
He works hard.

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:38.354
His daughter is more important
than work!

00:11:39.699 --> 00:11:41.860
They seem to have given up already.

00:11:43.869 --> 00:11:47.865
Sandra! Why did you join the gang?

00:11:48.015 --> 00:11:51.171
I have no father, no siblings...

00:11:55.147 --> 00:11:56.307
You...

00:11:56.457 --> 00:11:58.179
Keep quiet!

00:11:59.452 --> 00:12:01.712
Charlie likes you very much.

00:12:01.862 --> 00:12:04.813
You better be well-behaved, Candy.

00:12:33.819 --> 00:12:35.116
Come over!

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.650
Charlie.

00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:42.158
I've been waiting for you.

00:12:43.028 --> 00:12:44.922
Your uniform...

00:12:45.072 --> 00:12:46.390
Good looking, right?

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:47.989
Let me take a look.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.361
What's wrong with the uniform?

00:12:50.511 --> 00:12:52.863
Have you been to England?

00:12:53.013 --> 00:12:54.365
England?

00:12:54.515 --> 00:12:57.238
It's the uniform of St. Paul Academy.

00:12:57.510 --> 00:13:00.738
Terry already said that before.

00:13:00.888 --> 00:13:02.508
Terry?

00:13:02.715 --> 00:13:05.582
You know Terrius Grandchester?

00:13:05.751 --> 00:13:09.551
Yes, it was about a month ago...

00:13:13.692 --> 00:13:15.660
Charlie, get ready!

00:13:17.029 --> 00:13:20.556
Stop! I have a word with you!

00:13:23.602 --> 00:13:25.126
Terry?

00:13:26.705 --> 00:13:29.367
Aren't you Terry?

00:13:29.975 --> 00:13:32.273
Charlie! It's you, Charlie!

00:13:32.878 --> 00:13:35.873
You're back to America, Terry!

00:13:36.023 --> 00:13:38.348
You haven't changed a bit.

00:13:39.018 --> 00:13:40.451
You too.

00:13:43.656 --> 00:13:46.050
Is Terry still around?

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:49.486
He stayed for only one night.

00:13:49.636 --> 00:13:51.563
He was going somewhere
and looking for something.

00:13:51.764 --> 00:13:53.493
We missed each other.

00:13:58.904 --> 00:14:00.735
Do you like the drama?

00:14:03.142 --> 00:14:05.169
The drama is a kind of magic.

00:14:05.319 --> 00:14:09.305
You can be anyone, once you're in it.

00:14:09.582 --> 00:14:12.244
No matter what kind of characters.

00:14:12.685 --> 00:14:17.850
The orphan, the prince, the hero.
You can be anyone.

00:14:18.691 --> 00:14:21.558
I love the drama very much.

00:14:23.596 --> 00:14:25.359
Terry.

00:14:25.831 --> 00:14:28.559
You like Terry, don't you?

00:14:28.709 --> 00:14:30.161
How come...?

00:14:30.311 --> 00:14:34.502
You become lovely
when we talk about him.

00:14:35.241 --> 00:14:37.300
It's okay, let's dance.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.437
Wait!
Are you the leader of the gang?

00:14:40.587 --> 00:14:42.537
Don't be so unpleasant.

00:14:42.948 --> 00:14:45.743
Sorry, I have a request.

00:14:45.893 --> 00:14:47.411
What is it?

00:14:47.561 --> 00:14:50.181
Can Sandra quit the gang?

00:14:50.331 --> 00:14:52.783
It was her idea to join us.

00:14:52.933 --> 00:14:55.452
- So, she can leave?
- Candy!

00:14:58.364 --> 00:14:59.657
What are you doing?

00:14:59.807 --> 00:15:03.594
Mind your own business!
I have my own ideas.

00:15:03.744 --> 00:15:06.797
Joining the gang isn't your idea.

00:15:07.106 --> 00:15:09.533
Stop talking like that!

00:15:09.683 --> 00:15:12.703
Why are you interfering?

00:15:12.853 --> 00:15:17.806
It's not my business,
but your father is being sad.

00:15:19.218 --> 00:15:22.016
Officious! Let's go, Charlie.

00:15:23.389 --> 00:15:24.856
Papa!

00:15:32.164 --> 00:15:33.257
Don't hit her!

00:15:33.407 --> 00:15:36.360
Sandra is lonely, that's why she joined...

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:38.903
She is not the only one who felt lonely.

00:15:39.138 --> 00:15:43.400
If you pester my daughter again,
I'll break your arms!

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:45.067
As you wish.

00:15:47.079 --> 00:15:48.172
Stop it, Idiot!

00:15:48.322 --> 00:15:51.705
Charlie,
why do you listen to an old man?

00:15:53.052 --> 00:15:55.646
Do you think I will fear a knife?

00:15:55.796 --> 00:15:57.245
What?

00:15:57.856 --> 00:15:59.380
Your hands are shivering.

00:15:59.658 --> 00:16:01.057
Damn it!

00:16:02.361 --> 00:16:04.420
Don't be silly. Stop it!

00:16:04.697 --> 00:16:05.823
Stop it!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:09.563
Stop it, Jose!

00:16:13.072 --> 00:16:15.097
Stop it! Don't hurt my father!

00:16:16.442 --> 00:16:18.342
- Damn!
- Stop it!

00:16:23.615 --> 00:16:25.139
Sandra!

00:16:25.551 --> 00:16:26.848
Papa!

00:16:27.186 --> 00:16:28.813
Papa!

00:16:34.593 --> 00:16:36.288
Sandra!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.771
Thanks for your help.

00:16:53.921 --> 00:16:56.006
The help is from you!

00:16:56.156 --> 00:16:58.345
I will look after Cookie.

00:16:58.550 --> 00:17:02.987
After I will fully recover,
I'll work with Captain Nieven.

00:17:03.522 --> 00:17:05.145
Congratulations, Cookie!

00:17:05.295 --> 00:17:09.021
For your courage and friendship.

00:17:09.762 --> 00:17:11.121
Thanks.

00:17:11.271 --> 00:17:15.459
I have a present for you too, Cookie.

00:17:15.609 --> 00:17:17.261
Become a good sailor.

00:17:17.411 --> 00:17:18.629
Certainly!

00:17:18.779 --> 00:17:23.107
Candy, a present from France by papa.

00:17:25.411 --> 00:17:28.039
It's too precious, I can't take it.

00:17:28.247 --> 00:17:30.140
Please accept it, Candy.

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:34.511
The glove is Sandra's compliment.

00:17:34.661 --> 00:17:36.144
Sandra.

00:17:37.056 --> 00:17:39.820
I won't be lonely anymore.

00:17:42.227 --> 00:17:43.922
Candy.

00:17:44.863 --> 00:17:46.857
Just in time, brother!

00:17:47.007 --> 00:17:49.332
We have brought you food, Candy!

00:17:50.102 --> 00:17:51.362
So many?

00:17:51.512 --> 00:17:53.268
It's enough for an elephant.

00:17:53.839 --> 00:17:54.965
Captain.

00:17:57.176 --> 00:17:59.644
Get on the train quickly.

00:18:04.149 --> 00:18:06.443
Thank you, everyone!

00:18:06.593 --> 00:18:10.010
May Candice White have a safe trip.
Salute!

00:18:13.392 --> 00:18:14.825
Good-bye!

00:18:16.028 --> 00:18:20.488
Good-bye!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.926
Good-bye, Cookie.

00:18:23.076 --> 00:18:27.631
Good-bye, captain Nieven, Sandra,
Viva, Vokado.

00:19:01.039 --> 00:19:03.769
The kind grandfather and Pinky...

00:19:04.309 --> 00:19:06.500
Cordial shopkeeper...

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:11.007
Mr. Carson of the village,
captain Juskin...

00:19:11.157 --> 00:19:16.053
With all your help,
I was able to return to America.

00:19:16.922 --> 00:19:21.018
The people along the journey,
whom I may never meet again...

00:19:25.097 --> 00:19:27.292
It's getting cold.

00:19:31.803 --> 00:19:35.762
Sister Pony, Sister Lane,
I'm now coming home.

00:19:39.077 --> 00:19:41.045
It's snowing!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.277
We did it, Kurin!

00:20:20.427 --> 00:20:22.752
Let's go find a carriage.

00:20:28.093 --> 00:20:30.823
A carriage!
It's heading towards the village!

00:20:34.132 --> 00:20:37.465
Just a moment! Take me with you!

00:20:40.772 --> 00:20:42.239
We missed it...

00:20:47.512 --> 00:20:51.448
There's a passenger on the carriage.

00:20:52.284 --> 00:20:58.120
Both Terry and Candy didn't knew that.

00:20:58.957 --> 00:21:05.419
Terry should be in New York,
why did he come here?

00:21:06.064 --> 00:21:13.368
They did not found each other.
They are farther and farther apart.
